    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"MDS: Link Squared Distance Matrix and Gram Matrix in Practice\"\nauthor: \"Lieven Clement\"\ndate: \"statOmics, Ghent University (https://statomics.github.io)\"\nformat:\n  html: default\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n# Data\n\nPart of the iris dataset\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nX <- iris[1:5,1:4] |> as.matrix()\nX\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>   Sepal.Length Sepal.Width Petal.Length Petal.Width\n#> 1          5.1         3.5          1.4         0.2\n#> 2          4.9         3.0          1.4         0.2\n#> 3          4.7         3.2          1.3         0.2\n#> 4          4.6         3.1          1.5         0.2\n#> 5          5.0         3.6          1.4         0.2\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Centering\n\n\\[\n  \\mathbf{H} = \\mathbf{I} - \\frac{1}{n} \\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^T ,\n\\]\n\\[\n \\mathbf{X}_c = \\mathbf{H}\\mathbf{X}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\mathbf{H}\\mathbf{X}_c = \\mathbf{X}_c\n\\]\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nH <- diag(nrow(X)) - matrix(1/nrow(X),nrow=nrow(X),ncol=nrow(X))\nXc <- H%*%X\ncolMeans(Xc)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>  Sepal.Length   Sepal.Width  Petal.Length   Petal.Width \n#>  2.220446e-16  0.000000e+00  1.576517e-17 -8.326673e-18\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nH%*%Xc-Xc\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>       Sepal.Length   Sepal.Width  Petal.Length  Petal.Width\n#> [1,] -2.220446e-16  5.551115e-17 -1.521006e-17 8.326673e-18\n#> [2,] -2.289835e-16  0.000000e+00 -1.521006e-17 8.326673e-18\n#> [3,] -2.498002e-16 -1.387779e-17 -2.775558e-17 8.326673e-18\n#> [4,] -2.220446e-16 -2.775558e-17 -1.387779e-17 8.326673e-18\n#> [5,] -2.220446e-16  0.000000e+00 -1.756928e-17 8.326673e-18\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Gram matrix\n\n**Gram matrix**: $\\mathbf{G}=\\mathbf{X}\\mathbf{X}^T$\nHere we work on centered data so\n$\\mathbf{G}=\\mathbf{X}_c\\mathbf{X}_c^T$\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nG <- Xc%*%t(Xc)\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Squared Distance matrix\n\n\\[\n  \\mathbf{D}_X = \\mathbf{N} - 2\\mathbf{X}\\mathbf{X}^T + \\mathbf{N}^T ,\n\\]\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nN <- matrix(diag(G),nrow(Xc),nrow(Xc))\nN\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>       [,1]  [,2]  [,3]  [,4]  [,5]\n#> [1,] 0.106 0.106 0.106 0.106 0.106\n#> [2,] 0.080 0.080 0.080 0.080 0.080\n#> [3,] 0.042 0.042 0.042 0.042 0.042\n#> [4,] 0.110 0.110 0.110 0.110 0.110\n#> [5,] 0.122 0.122 0.122 0.122 0.122\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndist2 <- N-2*G+t(N)\ndist2\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>      [,1] [,2] [,3] [,4] [,5]\n#> [1,] 0.00 0.29 0.26 0.42 0.02\n#> [2,] 0.29 0.00 0.09 0.11 0.37\n#> [3,] 0.26 0.09 0.00 0.06 0.26\n#> [4,] 0.42 0.11 0.06 0.00 0.42\n#> [5,] 0.02 0.37 0.26 0.42 0.00\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndist(Xc)^2\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>      1    2    3    4\n#> 2 0.29               \n#> 3 0.26 0.09          \n#> 4 0.42 0.11 0.06     \n#> 5 0.02 0.37 0.26 0.42\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Link Gram Matrix and Squared Distance Matrix\n\n\\[\\mathbf{G} =\\mathbf{X}_c\\mathbf{X}_c^T=-\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{H}\\mathbf{D}_X\\mathbf{H}\\]\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nG\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>        [,1]   [,2]   [,3]   [,4]   [,5]\n#> [1,]  0.106 -0.052 -0.056 -0.102  0.104\n#> [2,] -0.052  0.080  0.016  0.040 -0.084\n#> [3,] -0.056  0.016  0.042  0.046 -0.048\n#> [4,] -0.102  0.040  0.046  0.110 -0.094\n#> [5,]  0.104 -0.084 -0.048 -0.094  0.122\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n-1/2*H%*%dist2%*%H\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>        [,1]   [,2]   [,3]   [,4]   [,5]\n#> [1,]  0.106 -0.052 -0.056 -0.102  0.104\n#> [2,] -0.052  0.080  0.016  0.040 -0.084\n#> [3,] -0.056  0.016  0.042  0.046 -0.048\n#> [4,] -0.102  0.040  0.046  0.110 -0.094\n#> [5,]  0.104 -0.084 -0.048 -0.094  0.122\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n-1/2*H%*%dist2%*%H - G\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>               [,1]          [,2]          [,3]          [,4]          [,5]\n#> [1,] -8.326673e-17 -5.551115e-17  6.938894e-18 -4.163336e-17 -6.938894e-17\n#> [2,] -8.326673e-17  0.000000e+00  3.122502e-17  5.551115e-17 -4.163336e-17\n#> [3,] -1.387779e-17  3.469447e-17  7.632783e-17  9.714451e-17  0.000000e+00\n#> [4,]  1.387779e-17  4.857226e-17  9.020562e-17  1.249001e-16  1.387779e-17\n#> [5,] -8.326673e-17 -4.163336e-17 -1.387779e-17  4.163336e-17 -4.163336e-17\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Show that N cancels out when multiplying with H\n\n\\[ \\mathbf{H N H} = \\mathbf{0}\\]\n\n\\[ \\mathbf{H N}^T \\mathbf{H} = \\mathbf{0}\\]\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nN%*%H\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>               [,1]          [,2]          [,3]         [,4]          [,5]\n#> [1,]  9.048318e-19  9.048318e-19 -6.034062e-18 9.048318e-19 -3.619327e-18\n#> [2,] -8.520962e-18 -1.582068e-18  5.356826e-18 1.887379e-18  6.328271e-18\n#> [3,] -4.662937e-19  3.003153e-18  3.003153e-18 1.268430e-18  1.865175e-18\n#> [4,]  8.604228e-19  8.604228e-19  8.604228e-19 8.604228e-19 -3.441691e-18\n#> [5,]  7.271961e-19  7.271961e-19  7.271961e-19 7.271961e-19 -2.908784e-18\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nH%*%t(N)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#>               [,1]          [,2]          [,3]          [,4]          [,5]\n#> [1,]  9.048318e-19 -8.520962e-18 -4.662937e-19  8.604228e-19  7.271961e-19\n#> [2,]  9.048318e-19 -1.582068e-18  3.003153e-18  8.604228e-19  7.271961e-19\n#> [3,] -6.034062e-18  5.356826e-18  3.003153e-18  8.604228e-19  7.271961e-19\n#> [4,]  9.048318e-19  1.887379e-18  1.268430e-18  8.604228e-19  7.271961e-19\n#> [5,] -3.619327e-18  6.328271e-18  1.865175e-18 -3.441691e-18 -2.908784e-18\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n# Session info {-}\n\n<details><summary>Session info</summary>\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#> [1] \"2026-09-15 16:30:57 CEST\"\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n#> ─ Session info ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#>  setting  value\n#>  version  R version 4.6.1 (2026-06-24)\n#>  os       macOS Tahoe 26.1\n#>  system   aarch64, darwin23\n#>  ui       X11\n#>  language (EN)\n#>  collate  nl_BE.UTF-8\n#>  ctype    nl_BE.UTF-8\n#>  tz       Europe/Brussels\n#>  date     2026-09-15\n#>  pandoc   3.10.2 @ /opt/homebrew/bin/ (via rmarkdown)\n#>  quarto   1.9.37 @ /usr/local/bin/quarto\n#> \n#> ─ Packages ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#>  package      * version date (UTC) lib source\n#>  cli            3.6.6   2026-04-09 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  digest         0.6.39  2025-11-19 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  dplyr        * 1.2.1   2026-04-03 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  evaluate       1.0.5   2025-08-27 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  farver         2.1.2   2024-05-13 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  fastmap        1.2.0   2024-05-15 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  forcats      * 1.0.1   2025-09-25 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  generics       0.1.4   2025-05-09 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  ggplot2      * 4.0.3   2026-04-22 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  glue           1.8.1   2026-04-17 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  gtable         0.3.6   2024-10-25 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  hms            1.1.4   2025-10-17 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  htmltools      0.5.9   2025-12-04 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  htmlwidgets    1.6.4   2023-12-06 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  jsonlite       2.0.0   2025-03-27 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  knitr          1.51    2025-12-20 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  lifecycle      1.0.5   2026-01-08 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  lubridate    * 1.9.5   2026-02-04 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  magrittr       2.0.5   2026-04-04 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  otel           0.2.0   2025-08-29 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  pillar         1.11.1  2025-09-17 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  pkgconfig      2.0.3   2019-09-22 [1] CRAN (R 4.6.0)\n#>  purrr       